- **Dates:** Sept 12-15 falls on different weekdays in 2026 and 2027. The 2026 days are Saturday to Tuesday. Brooklyn is closed Monday and Tuesday, so it only works on the weekend days of the window.
- **Price gaps:** The CMOM and Brooklyn pages I read did not post a current ticket price, so I left those out.
- **Where the facts come from:** CMOM's hours are from its visitor guidelines page. The Brooklyn hours are from its own Visit page, which was not recently updated, so the museum's calendar is worth a look.
